DOCUMENT();
loadMacros('PGstandard.pl', 'MathObjects.pl', 'PGcourse.pl');
TEXT(beginproblem());
$showPartialCorrectAnswers = 0;
$prompt = <<'PROMPT_34A7_6A77';
<p>34a7_6a77</p> <h4>Three-Point Test Cross Problem</h4><p>A test cross is a way to explore the relationship between genes and their respective alleles. It is a useful tool for genetic mapping and deciphering the inheritance of traits. Specifically, a three-point test cross examines three (3) genes at the same time to learn about their assortment in gamete formation.</p><p>A standard three-point test cross involves crossing a heterozygous organism for all three genes with an organism that is homozygous recessive for all three genes</p> <p>For this problem, a test cross using a fruit fly (<i>Drosophila melanogaster</i>) heterozygous for three genes was conducted to understand their genetic interactions.</p><h6>Characteristics of Recessive Phenotypes</h6><p><ul><li><strong><span style="color: #993e11;">Gene D</span></strong> is related to the '<span style="color: #993e11;"><i>dewy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #993e11;">Gene D</span> appears moist, with its body covered in tiny droplets of water.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene N</span></strong> is analogous to the '<span style="color: #286d3f;"><i>nerdy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #286d3f;">Gene N</span> has large, prominent eyes that stand out, much like thick-rimmed glasses.</li> <li><strong><span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene W</span></strong> is correlated with the '<span style="color: #1d5bb5;"><i>waxy</i></span>' phenotype. A fruit fly that is homozygous recessive for <span style="color: #1d5bb5;">Gene W</span> has a thick protective layer that is water resistant and opague.</li> </ul></p><table style="border-collapse: collapse; border: 2px solid black;"><tr><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Phenotype</span></th><th colspan="3" align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Genotypes</span></th><th align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">Progeny<br/>Count</span></th></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, nerdy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">16,359</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">23,805</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">9,146</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">dewy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffe4da; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">d</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">723</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy, waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">792</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">nerdy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #d4f4d6; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">n</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">9,329</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">waxy</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #e2eaff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #000000;">w</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">23,620</span></td></tr><tr><td align="left" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;">&nbsp;<span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;"><i>wildtype</i></span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #993e11;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #286d3f;">+</span></td><td align="center" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #f8f8f8; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: large; color: #1d5bb5;">+</span></td><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">16,226</span></td></tr><tr><th colspan="4" align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #cccccc; padding: 10px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">TOTAL =</span></th><td align="right" style="border: 1px solid black; background-color: #ffffff; padding: 5px;"><span style="font-size: medium; color: #000000;">100,000</span></td></tr></table><p>The resulting phenotypes are summarized in the table above.</p> <h6>Question</h6> <p>With the progeny data from the table, and using only the genotypes that result from crossover events between the two genes <b>N</b> and <b>W</b> during meiosis.</p> <p><strong>calculate the genetic distance between the two genes <b>N</b> and <b>W</b>,</strong> expressing your answer in centimorgans (cM)</p>
PROMPT_34A7_6A77
loadMacros('parserRadioButtons.pl');
$choice_1 = <<'LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_1';
<sup>(23,620 + 23,805)</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = <sup>47,425</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = 0.4743 = <strong>47.42 cM</strong>
LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_1
$choice_2 = <<'LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_2';
<sup>(723 + 792 + 16,226 + 16,359)</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = <sup>34,100</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = 0.3410 = <strong>34.10 cM</strong>
LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_2
$choice_3 = <<'LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_3';
<sup>(723 + 792 + 9,146 + 9,329)</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = <sup>19,990</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = 0.1999 = <strong>19.99 cM</strong>
LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_3
$choice_4 = <<'LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_4';
<sup>(723 + 9,146 + 9,329 + 16,226)</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = <sup>35,424</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = 0.3542 = <strong>35.42 cM</strong>
LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_4
$choice_5 = <<'LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_5';
<sup>(792 + 9,146 + 9,329 + 23,620)</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = <sup>42,887</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = 0.4289 = <strong>42.89 cM</strong>
LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_5
$choice_6 = <<'LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_6';
<sup>(792 + 9,329 + 16,359 + 23,805)</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = <sup>50,285</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = 0.5029 = <strong>50.29 cM</strong>
LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CHOICE_6
$correct_1 = <<'LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CORRECT_1';
<sup>(723 + 792 + 16,226 + 16,359)</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = <sup>34,100</sup>/<sub>100,000</sub> = 0.3410 = <strong>34.10 cM</strong>
LITERAL_34A7_6A77_CORRECT_1
@choices = ($choice_1, $choice_2, $choice_3, $choice_4, $choice_5, $choice_6);
$answer = RadioButtons([@choices], $correct_1, labels => 'ABC', displayLabels => 1, randomize => 0, noindex => 1, separator => '<div style="margin-bottom: 0.7em;"></div>');
TEXT(MODES(HTML => $prompt, TeX => ''));
BEGIN_TEXT
\{$answer->buttons\}
END_TEXT
ANS($answer->cmp);

